93	    /**
94	     * Get the data that this form submits, using the browser's <i>successful controls</i> semantics: controls are
95	     * returned in DOM order; controls without a {@code name}, disabled controls (including those inside a disabled
96	     * {@code fieldset}, excepting descendants of that fieldset's first {@code legend} child), and {@code button} /
97	     * {@code reset} / {@code submit} / {@code image} inputs are excluded;
98	     * checkboxes and radios are only included when {@code checked} (defaulting to the value {@code "on"}); a
99	     * {@code select[multiple]} submits every selected option, while a single {@code select} with no selected option
100	     * falls back to its first non-disabled option. Options that are disabled, either directly or by a disabled
101	     * {@code optgroup} ancestor, are never submitted. The list is re-queried from the DOM on each call, so changes to
102	     * the document are reflected. The returned list is a copy of the data, and changes to the contents of the
103	     * list will not be reflected in the DOM.
104	     * @return a list of key vals
105	     */
